    "title": "Kohl’s Holiday Hours and 2026 Schedule",
    "text": "January 2, 2026 3 min Read Lokibaho / Getty Images Commitment to Our Readers GOBankingRates' editorial team is committed to bringing you unbiased reviews and information. We use data-driven methodologies to evaluate financial products and services - our reviews and ratings are not influenced by advertisers. You can read more about our editorial guidelines and our products and services review methodology. 20 YearsHelping You Live Richer Reviewed by Experts Trusted by Millions of Readers Kohl’s is a popular retailer for clothing, home goods, toys and seasonal items. Whether you’re running errands, shopping for gifts or planning around a major holiday, it helps to know when Kohl’s stores are open. Here’s a complete guide to Kohl’s hours, holiday schedule and shopping options for this year. Kohl’s Regular Business Hours Most Kohl’s stores follow this general schedule: Day Hours Monday through Friday 10 a.m. to 9 p.m. Saturday 10 a.m. to 9 p.m. Sunday 10 a.m. to 8 p.m. Holidays That May Affect Kohl’s Business Hours Here are the 2026 federal holidays that may affect the business hours for your local Kohl’s: Holiday Date New Year’s Day Thursday, Jan. 1 Martin Luther King, Jr. Day Monday, Jan. 19 Presidents Day Monday, Feb. 16 Easter Sunday Sunday, April 5 Memorial Day Monday, May 25 Juneteenth National Independence Day Friday, June 19 Independence Day Saturday, July 4 Labor Day Monday, Sept. 7 Columbus Day/Indigenous Peoples Day Monday, Oct. 12 Veterans Day Wednesday, Nov. 11 Thanksgiving Day Thursday, Nov. 26 Christmas Day Friday, Dec. 25 Local Kohl’s Store Hours May Vary Kohl’s stores follow different schedules depending on location, local shopping patterns and regional regulations. Stores inside shopping centers or near major retail districts may adjust hours during the holiday season. Use the Kohl’s Store Locator to confirm operating hours for your local store. What If You Need To Shop While Kohl’s Is Closed? Even if your local Kohl’s is closed for major holidays, you still have several ways to shop or redeem rewards: Shop anytime online Use the Kohl’s App for online-only deals Check store inventory before visiting Schedule pickup for the next available day Earn and redeem Kohl’s Cash online How To Contact Kohl’s If you need support when stores are closed or outside regular hours, you can reach Kohl’s through: Phone: 1-855-564-5705 Mobile app: Available on iOS and Android Store locator: For local hours and pickup availability Online support and chat remain available when stores are closed for the holidays. Final Tips for Shopping at Kohl’s The holiday season can be overwhelming so it is good to keep these points in mind as you shop: Check store hours early: Holiday schedules vary by location. Use curbside pickup: Avoid lines by ordering ahead. Stack discounts: Combine coupons, sale prices and Kohl’s Cash. Plan around closures: Stores are closed on Thanksgiving and Christmas. Shop online first: Many seasonal promotions appear online early. More Holiday Hours Apple Costco CVS Home Depot Lowe’s Macy’s Safeway Starbucks Target Trader Joe’s Walgreens Walmart Kohl's Hours: FAQ Here are the answers to some of the most frequently asked questions about Kohl’s holiday hours and how they work: Is Kohl’s open on holidays? Yes. Most stores remain open except on Thanksgiving and Christmas. Do Kohl’s hours change during the holidays? Yes. Hours are often extended during major sales periods and reduced on holiday eves. Can I shop at Kohl’s when stores are closed? Yes. Kohls.com and the Kohl’s App remain available. Does Kohl’s open early for Black Friday? Yes. Most locations open early with extended hours. Are Kohl’s stores open on Christmas Eve? Yes, but stores will close early. Lydia Kibet, Caitlyn Moorhead, Melanie Grafil and Amber Barkley contributed to the reporting for this article. All holiday hours were confirmed as of Dec. 29, 2025. Check with your local retailer to confirm specific hours. Hours and policies are subject to change. Editorial Note: This content is not provided by any entity covered in this article. Any opinions, analyses, reviews, ratings or recommendations expressed in this article are those of the author alone and have not been reviewed, approved or otherwise endorsed by any entity named in this article.",
